{
    "title": "Nintendo Music",
    "description": "Presenting an app for enjoying music from Nintendo games! Reliving your musical memories from across Nintendo's franchises, from Super Mario\u2122 to Animal Crossing and beyond, is now just a tap away.\r\nNote: A Nintendo Switch Online membership is required to access this app.\r\n\r\n\u25c6Tracks from Games Including\r\n\u30fb Pikmin\u2122 4\r\n\u30fb Pok\u00e9mon\u2122 Scarlet and Pok\u00e9mon Violet\r\n\u30fb Splatoon\u2122 3\r\n\u30fb Animal Crossing\u2122: New Horizons\r\n\u30fb Kirby\u2122 Star Allies\r\n\u30fb Mario Kart\u2122 8 Deluxe\r\n\u30fb The Legend of Zelda\u2122: Breath of the Wild\r\n\u30fb Metroid Prime\u2122\r\n\u30fb Fire Emblem\u2122: The Blazing Blade\r\n\u30fb Donkey Kong Country\u2122\r\nNote: Not all tracks from all games will be included.\r\n\r\n\u25c6Extended Playback\r\nLengthen the duration of certain tracks to 15, 30, or 60 minutes to enjoy an uninterrupted listening experience, great for enhancing the atmosphere while studying or working.\r\nNote: This feature is available only for certain tracks.\r\n\r\n\u25c6Offline Playback\r\nDownload tracks to your device for offline listening.\r\n\r\n\u25c6Background Playback\r\nPlay tracks in the background, while your device's screen is off or if you're using a different app.\r\n\r\n\u25c6Create Playlists\r\nOrganize tracks into personalized playlists.\r\n\r\nNotes:\r\n\u25cf Nintendo Switch Online membership (sold separately) and Nintendo Account required. Membership autorenews after initial term at the then-current price unless canceled. Not available in all countries. Internet access required for online features. Terms apply. nintendo.com/switch-online\r\n\u25cf Nintendo Account required to become a member of Nintendo Switch Online\r\n\u25cf Your device must be running Android 9.0 or later to enjoy Nintendo Music\r\n\r\nNintendo Account User Agreement: https://accounts.nintendo.com/term_chooser/eula\r\n\r\n\u00a9 Nintendo",
    "descriptionHTML": "Presenting an app for enjoying music from Nintendo games! Reliving your musical memories from across Nintendo&#39;s franchises, from Super Mario\u2122 to Animal Crossing and beyond, is now just a tap away.<br>Note: A Nintendo Switch Online membership is required to access this app.<br><br>\u25c6Tracks from Games Including<br>\u30fb Pikmin\u2122 4<br>\u30fb Pok\u00e9mon\u2122 Scarlet and Pok\u00e9mon Violet<br>\u30fb Splatoon\u2122 3<br>\u30fb Animal Crossing\u2122: New Horizons<br>\u30fb Kirby\u2122 Star Allies<br>\u30fb Mario Kart\u2122 8 Deluxe<br>\u30fb The Legend of Zelda\u2122: Breath of the Wild<br>\u30fb Metroid Prime\u2122<br>\u30fb Fire Emblem\u2122: The Blazing Blade<br>\u30fb Donkey Kong Country\u2122<br>Note: Not all tracks from all games will be included.<br><br>\u25c6Extended Playback<br>Lengthen the duration of certain tracks to 15, 30, or 60 minutes to enjoy an uninterrupted listening experience, great for enhancing the atmosphere while studying or working.<br>Note: This feature is available only for certain tracks.<br><br>\u25c6Offline Playback<br>Download tracks to your device for offline listening.<br><br>\u25c6Background Playback<br>Play tracks in the background, while your device&#39;s screen is off or if you&#39;re using a different app.<br><br>\u25c6Create Playlists<br>Organize tracks into personalized playlists.<br><br>Notes:<br>\u25cf Nintendo Switch Online membership (sold separately) and Nintendo Account required. Membership autorenews after initial term at the then-current price unless canceled. Not available in all countries. Internet access required for online features. Terms apply. nintendo.com/switch-online<br>\u25cf Nintendo Account required to become a member of Nintendo Switch Online<br>\u25cf Your device must be running Android 9.0 or later to enjoy Nintendo Music<br><br>Nintendo Account User Agreement: https://accounts.nintendo.com/term_chooser/eula<br><br>\u00a9 Nintendo",
